	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Unlike most undead entities macabre still require food and drink. However, the quality required for function sets a much lower bar. Spoiled food still functions as supply for a macabre with no ill effects. 3 pounds of decaying matter, plant or animal, also functions as 1 supply. Finally, macabre are also immune to foodborne disease and ingested poisons.</p>",
